          "generalFeedback": "HICCUPPS is a heuristic list of oracles — ways to recognise a problem by an inconsistency: with History, Image, Comparable products, Claims, User expectations, the Product itself, its Purpose, and Standards. It answers \"how would I know this is a bug?\"",
