          "generalFeedback": "The log's four note types capture different kinds of finding: Bug (a confirmed problem), Observation (a neutral fact seen), Question (an open point to resolve), and Idea (a suggestion for later). An unresolved doubt about expected behaviour is a Question — flagged now so it is not lost, and answered later.",
          "single": true
