          "generalFeedback": "Because tests are designed on the fly, the exact route to a defect can be lost. Session notes — captured in the Observation Log and exported as a record — preserve the inputs, steps, and environment so the finding can be reproduced and reported. This is why note-taking is treated as non-optional in SBTM.",
