          "name": "Interpret Stack: fake fails the second test",
          "text": "<p>In the Stack kata, <code>isEmpty()</code> was faked to return <code>true</code>. A new test pushes an item then asserts <code>isEmpty()</code> is false, and it fails. What does the Green phase now require?</p>",
